Output docs/assets/tui.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 480
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Shell bash

Type "# Interactive TUI — select distros, CNI, charts, versions"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "genesisrk tui --rancher=v2.13.1"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "# Tip: q or Ctrl+C exits at any step"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "genesisrk tui --help"
Enter
Sleep 2s
